data.creator_notes:
Important, to work correctly:
1. Switch to "Default" prompt in SillyTavern and enable the System Prompt attached to the card (this is where the main part is);
2. The {{user}} definition must be provided, to serve as the protagonist;
3. In your first message, only provide short description of the starting place (a dungeon, a town, a castle etc);
4. Tested with Claude 3 Sonnet, but still may omit important parts of output at first turn (check the screenshots in the Gallery section for reference). Features may not work as intended, depending of {{user}} definitions, LLM model, etc.
